{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T16:52:11+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-30T16:52:11+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Hanza AB (publ)","sector":"Technology","industry":"Electronic Components","country":"Sweden","city":"Kista","website":"https://www.hanza.com","employees":3431,"summary":"Hanza AB (publ), together with its subsidiaries, provides contract manufacturing solutions in Sweden, Finland, Estonia, Germany, Poland, the Czech Republic, rest of the European Union, Norway, rest of Europe, North America, and internationally. It operates through Main Markets, Other Markets, and Business Development and Services segments. The company offers machining solutions comprising grinding, turbine component, milling, turning, electrical discharge machining, assembly, logistics, and prototype services; sheet metal processing solutions consisting of punching and laser cutting, bending, welding, coating, and surface treatment services; heavy mechanics solutions; and electronics manufacturing solutions, including research and development, printed circuit board assembly, and research and development test development center services. It also provides wire harness solutions comprising automated cut-strip-crimp wire processing, cut and strip technology, crimp tool, low- and high-pressure molding of cables, cable and label marking, multi-channel testing, and ultrasonic welding services, as well as laser engraving, pad printing, and hot stamping for plastic parts; and assembly solutions, including design and development, test development, and design and adaptation services. In addition, the company offers business consulting; and tech solutions, including development projects, electronics, mechanics, and software. Hanza AB (publ) was incorporated in 2008 and is headquartered in Kista, Sweden.","exchange":"Stockholm","currency":"SEK","financial_currency":"SEK","summary_fr":"Hanza AB (publ), avec ses filiales, fournit des solutions de fabrication sous contrat en Suède, en Finlande, en Estonie, en Allemagne, en Pologne, en République tchèque, dans le reste de l'Union européenne, en Norvège, dans le reste de l'Europe, en Amérique du Nord et à l'international. Il opère à travers les principaux marchés, les autres marchés et les secteurs du développement des affaires et des services. La société propose des solutions d'usinage comprenant des services de meulage, de composants de turbine, de fraisage, de tournage, d'usinage par décharge électrique, d'assemblage, de logistique et de prototype; des solutions de traitement de tôle comprenant des services de poinçonnage et de découpe au laser, de pliage, de soudage, de revêtement et de traitement de surface; des solutions de mécanique lourde; et des solutions de fabrication électronique, y compris la recherche et le développement."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":10113905664,"shares_outstanding":62741350,"trailing_pe":24.686064,"forward_pe":27.986109,"price_to_book":2.3395207,"ev_to_ebitda":13.792,"ev_to_revenue":1.293,"dividend_yield":0.0091,"payout_ratio":0.2297,"beta_yahoo":null},"targets":{"current_price":161.2,"mean":188.33333,"median":187.0,"high":197.0,"low":181.0,"n_analysts":3,"reco_mean":1.5,"reco_key":"strong_buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-10-27"],"eps_avg":2.61,"eps_low":2.59,"eps_high":2.63,"revenue_avg":3054000000,"ex_dividend":"2026-05-13","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.51295,"institutions_pct":0.206,"institutions_float_pct":0.42296,"institutions_n":64,"institutions":[],"funds":[],"insider_trades":[]},"estimates":[{"period":"0q","end_date":"2026-12-31","eps_avg":2.61,"eps_low":2.59,"eps_high":2.63,"eps_year_ago":2.1608,"eps_n":2,"eps_growth":0.2079,"rev_avg":3054000000,"rev_low":2992000000,"rev_high":3116000000,"rev_year_ago":1779000000,"rev_n":2,"rev_growth":0.71669996,"eps_trend_now":2.61,"eps_trend_30d":2.57,"eps_trend_90d":2.55328},{"period":"+1q","e